        travel: "Tokyo → Hakone: Odakyu Romancecar from Shinjuku to Hakone-Yumoto, about 85 minutes; or Shinkansen Kodama/Hikari to Odawara in around 35 minutes, then the Hakone Tozan line. Fuji Five Lakes: about 2 to 2.5 hours by highway bus from Shinjuku.",
        tip: "Check the Owakudani ropeway status the night before. It closes without much notice when volcanic gas levels rise, and the replacement bus adds an hour to the loop.",
